dsInput` → return `Result{Status: decision.Status, Message: decision.Message}`.\n   6. **Prefix once, at the point the result leaves the step.** When the result being returned has `Status` `agentlib.AgentStatusFailed` or `agentlib.AgentStatusNeedsInput`, replace its `Message` with `PrefixMessage(message)`. Apply it to messages the gate generated **and** to messages the inner step passed through from the model. Do not prefix a `Done` message. Do not prefix twice — a line already starting with `> ` must not become `> > `.\n   7. `PrefixMessage` splits on `\"\\n\"`, prefixes every element with `> `, and joins with `\"\\n\"`. It is the only prefixing step in the package.\n\nCHUNK\nwc -c /workspace/prompts/1-spec-002-verdict-gate.md","description":"Append requirements 5-6"}}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash-max","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-878ead37275ea3cd","session_id":"d0a8f161-dbd4-4f10-88f7-931e909fc308","uuid":"44ca26e3-16ae-4ce5-b395-2d4972fc5694","timestamp":"2026-09-27T23:23:53.463Z","subagent_type":"dark-factory:prompt-creator","task_description":"Generate prompts for spec 002"}
